{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/litologia/espilita",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "spilite",
    "es": "espilita"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Altered basic to intermediate composition fine-grained igneous rock in which the feldspar is partially or completely composed of of albite, typically accompanied by chlorite, calcite, quartz, epidote, prehnite, and low-tempaerature hydrous crystallization products. preservation of eruptive volcanic features is typical.",
    "es": "Roca ígnea alterada de grano fino y composición básica a  intermedia en la que el feldespato está compuesto parcial o totalmente por albita, habitualmente acompañada por clorita, calcita, cuarzo, epidota, prehnita y productos de cristalización hidratados de baja temperatura. habitualmente conserva las características volcánicas eruptivas."
  },
  "broader": {
    "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/litologia/roca-metasomatica",
    "prefLabel": {
      "en": "metasomatic rock",
      "es": "roca metasomática"
    }
  },
